WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.966 --> 00:00:05.300
As our heroes continue to make their way

2
00:00:05.366 --> 00:00:08.200
toward Coumarine City and Ash's next Gym Battle,

3
00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:12.466
the forest they're passing through has everyone a bit nervous.

4
00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:16.166
- Will we get to the Pokémon Centre soon?
- Denne, denne.

5
00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:18.466
Looks like it should be just through this forest.

6
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.733
It's only a little bit farther, so don't worry, please?

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.700
OK.

8
00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.033
- What was that?
- Pika, pika!

9
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.700
- That had to be a Pokémon!
- Huh? Let's see!

10
00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:33.700
Snub! Snub! Snubbull!

11
00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:37.066
Snub! Snub! Snubbull!

12
00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.933
Snubbull!

13
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.766
- Huh?
- It's a Snubbull!

14
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:43.333
And that Hawlucha's threatening it!

15
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.600
Thunderbolt, Pikachu, go!

16
00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:49.133
- Pikachu!
- Ah!

17
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.333
Ga! Gallade!

18
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.700
- What's up with them?
- Pika!

19
00:00:57.766 --> 00:01:00.066
- Hey, are you all right?
- Haw!

20
00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:02.066
Gallade!

21
00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.400
Bull! Snubbull!

22
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.833
- What was that for?
- Pikachu!

23
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:15.166
Uh, you see, we were trying to give you a hand.

24
00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:16.333
Snubbull!

25
00:01:21.066 --> 00:01:24.100
What's going on?

26
00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:27.033
What have all of you done?

27
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.933
You will stop interrupting our rehearsal right now!

28
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.933
Huh? A rehearsal? Whoa!

29
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.733
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

30
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

31
00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

32
00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

33
00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:45.166
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

34
00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:48.600
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

35
00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:51.933
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

36
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

37
00:01:56.033 --> 00:02:00.633
♪ The future of the world is in your hand ♪

38
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

39
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:08.933
When Light and Dark Collide!

40
00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:17.400
My name's Carl, and I'm the theatre director.

41
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:19.166
Hi. I'm Ash.

42
00:02:19.233 --> 00:02:22.100
- And this is my partner, Pikachu.
- Pikachu!

43
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:24.066
- I'm Serena.
- I'm Clemont.

44
00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.333
My name's Bonnie.

45
00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.633
- And this is Dedenne.
- Denne!

46
00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.966
I'm sorry. I didn't know what was happening.

47
00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.866
And because of me, Gallade got hurt.

48
00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:34.866
Don't worry. It's all right.

49
00:02:34.933 --> 00:02:38.400
See, it looked to us like Snubbull was in big trouble.

50
00:02:38.466 --> 00:02:41.366
We had no idea what was really going on.

51
00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:44.233
We're in rehearsals for the Super Pokémon Battle Show.

52
00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.866
Super Pokémon Battle Show?

53
00:02:45.933 --> 00:02:49.600
Entertainment that goes far beyond the Pokémon battle!

54
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:50.500
Snubbull! Snubbull!

55
00:02:50.566 --> 00:02:53.033
The perfect blend of theatrics and battling!

56
00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.533
The likes of which have never been seen before!

57
00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.133
Gall!

58
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.033
I don't get it. Sorry.

59
00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.433
In other words, it's a battle with a scripted plot line.

60
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.333
Huh?

61
00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.400
Please allow me to explain.

62
00:03:07.466 --> 00:03:10.633
The show's about a villain called Dark and a hero called Shining.

63
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.866
The two of them settle their differences with a showdown battle.

64
00:03:13.933 --> 00:03:16.333
-Huh?

65
00:03:22.433 --> 00:03:24.333
Oh, Gallade!

66
00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:28.400
- Gallade's treatment is complete.
- Wigglytuff.

67
00:03:28.466 --> 00:03:30.333
Uh, is that leg going to be OK?

68
00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.133
I'd give it two or three days for it to heal up.

69
00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.966
Two or three days?

70
00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:38.733
Then it won't be able to perform in tomorrow's Super Pokémon Battle Show!

71
00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.100
- Gallade!
- Absolutely not!

72
00:03:41.166 --> 00:03:44.233
If you don't get enough rest, it'll take even longer to heal.

73
00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.600
Gal, Gallade, gal.

74
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:47.300
Aww.

75
00:03:47.366 --> 00:03:49.100
Well, it'll be all right.

76
00:03:49.166 --> 00:03:52.600
What can we do? We'll just have to cancel the show.

77
00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:56.166
It's my fault.

78
00:03:56.233 --> 00:03:59.366
I had no business getting in the middle of it in the first place.

79
00:03:59.433 --> 00:04:03.133
- Pika, pika.
- You were only trying to help.

80
00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.966
Huh? I know!

81
00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:09.000
What if you were to put in a different Pokémon to play the hero?

82
00:04:09.066 --> 00:04:10.466
Huh?

83
00:04:10.533 --> 00:04:11.733
That's a good idea.

84
00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.200
Except I'm afraid we don't have an understudy.

85
00:04:14.266 --> 00:04:16.666
I'm sure Ash's Hawlucha could do it!

86
00:04:16.733 --> 00:04:19.333
Huh?

87
00:04:19.399 --> 00:04:20.500
Time is short.

88
00:04:20.566 --> 00:04:23.200
But we have nothing to lose if we give it a try!

89
00:04:23.266 --> 00:04:25.166
Won't you consider helping us out? Please!

90
00:04:25.233 --> 00:04:27.866
- Of course I will!
- Pikachu!

91
00:04:27.933 --> 00:04:29.366
Thank you!

92
00:04:29.433 --> 00:04:33.233
All right, let me go rewrite the script for tomorrow's performance!

93
00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.066
Brilliant. A great idea!

94
00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.966
Now, Ash, time to bring out Hawlucha!

95
00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:48.666
OK! Hawlucha, I choose you!

96
00:04:53.766 --> 00:04:57.033
Check this out. This won't be a real battle.

97
00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.433
It'll be make-believe!

98
00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.200
Halu.

99
00:05:02.466 --> 00:05:04.900
The plot is essentially as I described it!

100
00:05:04.966 --> 00:05:08.200
This scene is the showdown between Shining Hawlucha, the hero,

101
00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:09.533
and Dark Hawlucha.

102
00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:13.700
It's the all-important moment when the hero rescues the Lady Snubbull!

103
00:05:13.766 --> 00:05:15.833
Initially, the villain will have the advantage,

104
00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.833
but with spectators cheering our hero on,

105
00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:21.900
Shining Hawlucha will stage a powerful comeback and win!

106
00:05:21.966 --> 00:05:24.600
What a plot. It sets me on fire!

107
00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:27.400
- You can do it. It sounds great!
- Pikachu!

108
00:05:27.466 --> 00:05:29.400
And... go!

109
00:05:29.466 --> 00:05:30.833
Lucha!

110
00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.433
Ha-cha!

111
00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.566
Dark Hawlucha, throw your opponent right now!

112
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:45.700
Huh?

113
00:05:45.766 --> 00:05:48.300
Go back! You're supposed to get thrown!

114
00:05:48.366 --> 00:05:52.400
- They call it acting!
- It's only make-believe! It's not real!

115
00:05:52.466 --> 00:05:53.700
Gallade!

116
00:05:53.766 --> 00:05:56.200
Please let Dark Hawlucha throw you!

117
00:05:56.266 --> 00:05:57.800
Run to the wall and then come back

118
00:05:57.866 --> 00:06:00.433
- to where Dark Hawlucha is!
- Ha-cha.

119
00:06:04.566 --> 00:06:05.633
Huh?

120
00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.866
Hawlucha!

121
00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:10.033
Oof!

122
00:06:11.666 --> 00:06:12.766
Ha-cha!

123
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:15.733
-Pika!

124
00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.266
No, that's wrong!

125
00:06:17.333 --> 00:06:20.033
This isn't a real battle, remember, Hawlucha?

126
00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.533
We know how much it hates losing.

127
00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:26.033
It's an act! There's no real loser and no winner!

128
00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.900
All of this drama's starting to give me a tummy ache.

129
00:06:28.966 --> 00:06:30.033
Denne-ne-ne.

130
00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.766
Please, Hawlucha! You've gotta do what Carl tells you to do!

131
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:36.766
Cha, Hawlucha.

132
00:06:36.833 --> 00:06:39.300
Lu...

133
00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:45.000
OK! Let's rehearse this scene one more time so we can get it just right!

134
00:06:46.066 --> 00:06:48.066
Shining Hawlucha, our hero!

135
00:06:48.133 --> 00:06:51.500
You're being attacked by Dark Hawlucha and about to lose!

136
00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.566
Ha-cha!

137
00:06:55.633 --> 00:06:58.033
You hit the wall, then rush back!

138
00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.866
Then Dark Hawlucha unleashes its Karate Chop!

139
00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:02.366
Cha!

140
00:07:02.433 --> 00:07:07.633
- Ha-cha!
- Lucha!

141
00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.600
Huh?

142
00:07:09.666 --> 00:07:12.300
Hawlucha, Hawlucha!

143
00:07:15.733 --> 00:07:16.900
- Huh?
- Pika!

144
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:19.100
No! That's not right!

145
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.500
What're you doing? Hawlucha!

146
00:07:21.566 --> 00:07:24.100
- Stop it! Both of you!
- Hah!

147
00:07:24.166 --> 00:07:26.866
-Knock it off!

148
00:07:26.933 --> 00:07:29.366
-Cha!

149
00:07:29.433 --> 00:07:32.666
Hawlucha! Lucha-cha-cha! Hm!

150
00:07:32.733 --> 00:07:35.566
Cha! Humph!

151
00:07:38.366 --> 00:07:40.733
No.

152
00:07:44.766 --> 00:07:47.500
The Pokémon performing in the Super Pokémon Battle Show

153
00:07:47.566 --> 00:07:50.033
are quite popular with the masses, no doubt.

154
00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.933
I'm sure the boss thinks they're cool too.

155
00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.266
So if we grab them and turn them into gifts...

156
00:07:55.333 --> 00:07:57.566
He'll have his own Super Pokémon Battle Show

157
00:07:57.633 --> 00:07:59.433
to watch any time he wants!

158
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.433
Or think of the money we'd make.

159
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.866
People love a good show. And we'd be the only one in town!

160
00:08:04.933 --> 00:08:08.600
So I suggest we get our show on the road.

161
00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.133
- Cha.
- Hawlucha?

162
00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.200
- Huh?
- Don't be sad.

163
00:08:19.266 --> 00:08:21.366
We all know you can do a great job!

164
00:08:21.433 --> 00:08:22.533
Serena's right!

165
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.766
Remember, this is the first time you've ever acted, right?

166
00:08:29.033 --> 00:08:30.500
Lucha, ha-cha.

167
00:08:30.566 --> 00:08:35.633
- So get back in there!
- Pika, pika!

168
00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.366
Cha, Hawlucha!

169
00:08:37.433 --> 00:08:38.733
-Huh?

170
00:08:38.799 --> 00:08:40.633
- Huh?
- What was that?

171
00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.966
Dark Hawlucha?

172
00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.866
Maybe it's working on stage dives.

173
00:08:58.433 --> 00:09:00.900
It sure moves fast.

174
00:09:00.966 --> 00:09:04.166
- You noticed, eh?
- Huh?

175
00:09:04.233 --> 00:09:06.500
Carl!

176
00:09:06.566 --> 00:09:07.700
It is quick.

177
00:09:07.766 --> 00:09:11.066
Although Dark Hawlucha only battles in shows now,

178
00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:13.700
it was so powerful that it competed in and won

179
00:09:13.766 --> 00:09:17.300
the Kalos region's prestigious Fighting-type Pokémon Tournament.

180
00:09:17.366 --> 00:09:20.633
You're looking at a true champion!

181
00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:30.033
- Whoa. Dark Hawlucha was a champion?
- Pika.

182
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.433
Yes. And I coached it in many tournaments.

183
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.300
But during one of those tournaments, it was hurt.

184
00:09:36.366 --> 00:09:38.766
Hawlucha hasn't competed in a full-on battle

185
00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:41.200
ever since that injury.

186
00:09:41.266 --> 00:09:44.866
So that's why I came up with the Super Pokémon Battle Show,

187
00:09:44.933 --> 00:09:48.333
which is much less physically demanding than a Pokémon battle is.

188
00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.200
So that's what happened.

189
00:09:50.266 --> 00:09:52.800
These days, Dark Hawlucha works hard

190
00:09:52.866 --> 00:09:55.333
to make our Super Pokémon Battle Shows the best!

191
00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.933
Lighting up the stage is its number one goal!

192
00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:02.200
- So it takes genuine pride in performing.
- Yes.

193
00:10:02.266 --> 00:10:03.833
Regardless of injury,

194
00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:07.400
Dark Hawlucha's always been a very proud Pokémon.

195
00:10:07.466 --> 00:10:11.933
Huh? Cha.

196
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.133
Who's that Pokémon?

197
00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.200
It's Snubbull!

198
00:10:21.266 --> 00:10:23.933
Snubbull!

199
00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:29.666
You got that? After you're thrown, you bounce off the wall

200
00:10:29.733 --> 00:10:32.466
and then Dark Hawlucha will use Karate Chop on you.

201
00:10:32.533 --> 00:10:35.066
Ha-cha!

202
00:10:35.133 --> 00:10:36.766
Ready, and go!

203
00:10:42.333 --> 00:10:45.500
Hah!

204
00:10:45.566 --> 00:10:48.033
Keep it up!

205
00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.000
- One more time!
- Lucha! Ha!

206
00:10:52.966 --> 00:10:55.000
All right! That's it for rehearsal!

207
00:10:55.066 --> 00:10:58.500
All that's left is tomorrow's show! Let's give it our all!

208
00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:01.500
I wonder if Hawlucha will be OK.

209
00:11:01.566 --> 00:11:03.300
I must admit I'm concerned.

210
00:11:03.366 --> 00:11:07.133
Don't worry. Hawlucha's gonna be just fine!

211
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.300
Pikachu!

212
00:11:10.566 --> 00:11:14.366
Good evening to the 20 million Super Pokémon Battle Show fans

213
00:11:14.433 --> 00:11:15.433
across the region!

214
00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.433
Get ready for a night of red-hot action.

215
00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.566
Let's hear you cheer!

216
00:11:21.633 --> 00:11:25.066
Whoa. So many people.

217
00:11:25.133 --> 00:11:27.600
I know. Even I'm nervous!

218
00:11:27.666 --> 00:11:29.566
I wonder if Hawlucha's nervous too.

219
00:11:29.633 --> 00:11:32.200
Hawlucha can handle it. No doubt.

220
00:11:32.266 --> 00:11:34.300
- What do you think?
- Pikachu!

221
00:11:43.866 --> 00:11:46.933
Hey, Jessie, you OK over there?

222
00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.600
The allure of the spotlight, it's calling my name!

223
00:11:49.666 --> 00:11:50.700
- Stop!
- Chill!

224
00:11:50.766 --> 00:11:52.766
If you'll cool your jets long enough to think,

225
00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:56.133
you'll remember the plan is to crash the Super Pokémon Battle Show

226
00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.133
during half time, and swipe all of those primo Pokémon!

227
00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.966
- Not yet!
- Who cares?

228
00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:11.966
Huh?

229
00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:13.200
- Who's that?
- Pika!

230
00:12:13.266 --> 00:12:14.600
Huh?

231
00:12:18.433 --> 00:12:22.100
Ha! No turning back now!

232
00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:24.100
♪ Ta-da! ♪

233
00:12:24.166 --> 00:12:26.100
Yeah!

234
00:12:26.166 --> 00:12:28.600
♪ Ta-da! ♪

235
00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:31.900
Huh?

236
00:12:31.966 --> 00:12:34.633
- Hold on! Who are you?
- Huh?

237
00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:36.900
Prepare for trouble, but not in the show!

238
00:12:36.966 --> 00:12:39.233
And make it double, we'll go with the flow!

239
00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.933
Hm! To protect the world from second-rate actors!

240
00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.466
Hm! To unite the crowd against detractors!

241
00:12:44.533 --> 00:12:47.166
To denounce the evils of... no class!

242
00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:50.666
To extend our reach, and do it en masse!

243
00:12:50.733 --> 00:12:52.166
- Jessie!
- And James.

244
00:12:52.233 --> 00:12:55.300
Team Rocket blasts off like a shooting star!

245
00:12:55.366 --> 00:12:59.166
Surrender the stage now. If not, better get ready to spar!

246
00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.166
Meowth. There you are!

247
00:13:02.233 --> 00:13:04.233
Wobbuffet!

248
00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.166
- Team Rocket?
- Stop! Dumb motto!

249
00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:09.600
Do you actually know who these buffoons are?

250
00:13:09.666 --> 00:13:12.833
They're bad guys who steal other people's Pokémon!

251
00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:16.166
Quiet! We're here because I'm going to steal the show!

252
00:13:16.233 --> 00:13:20.666
If someone doesn't get rid of these yahoos, I'm going to flip my lid!

253
00:13:20.733 --> 00:13:23.666
Right!

254
00:13:23.733 --> 00:13:26.866
Ugh! I'm supposed to be under the spotlight,

255
00:13:26.933 --> 00:13:29.733
- so you stay out of it!
- No, get on point.

256
00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.266
Stealing their Pokémon is why we're really here.

257
00:13:32.333 --> 00:13:34.166
Look, these melodramatic ding-a-lings

258
00:13:34.233 --> 00:13:37.133
have just made our joyous job a whole lot easier!

259
00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.233
We'll draw those dopes right in like a chump to the flame

260
00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.166
Step aside and stop being so lame!

261
00:13:42.233 --> 00:13:44.766
I guess stardom can wait.

262
00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:46.733
Pumpkaboo, on stage!

263
00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:50.100
OK, Inkay!

264
00:13:52.233 --> 00:13:54.100
- Pumpkaboo!
- Kay!

265
00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:55.366
Inkay, use Psybeam!

266
00:13:55.433 --> 00:13:59.900
- Inkay!
- Pika!

267
00:13:59.966 --> 00:14:02.200
Pika!

268
00:14:02.266 --> 00:14:03.700
Pikachu!

269
00:14:03.766 --> 00:14:06.033
Shadow Ball!

270
00:14:08.766 --> 00:14:11.433
Cha! Cha! Cha!

271
00:14:14.166 --> 00:14:16.600
Argh! Ha-cha.

272
00:14:19.233 --> 00:14:21.166
Lucha.

273
00:14:21.233 --> 00:14:24.900
-Huh? Lucha?

274
00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.900
- Lucha.
- Lucha.

275
00:14:27.966 --> 00:14:29.266
-Pika.

276
00:14:29.333 --> 00:14:31.766
- Use Psybeam!
- You use Shadow Ball!

277
00:14:34.966 --> 00:14:38.633
Hawlucha!

278
00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.233
Ha-cha!

279
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.866
Lucha.

280
00:14:44.933 --> 00:14:48.033
-Lucha!

281
00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:51.400
We're blasting off again!

282
00:14:51.466 --> 00:14:54.533
Wobbuffet!

283
00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:59.300
- Yeah, all right!
- Chawlu. Hawlu.

284
00:15:06.866 --> 00:15:10.666
Hey, look! The audience thinks it was part of the show!

285
00:15:10.733 --> 00:15:14.800
Aaah. All right, then the show must go on.

286
00:15:14.866 --> 00:15:17.566
Thanks for your enthusiasm!

287
00:15:17.633 --> 00:15:22.800
Next up, our evening's main event, the Super Pokémon Battle!

288
00:15:22.866 --> 00:15:24.133
Snubbull!

289
00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:27.800
Oh no! Dark Hawlucha is trying to take away Lady Snubbull,

290
00:15:27.866 --> 00:15:29.000
who doesn't look happy!

291
00:15:29.066 --> 00:15:32.666
But look up! It's the hero of justice,

292
00:15:32.733 --> 00:15:34.600
Shining Hawlucha!

293
00:15:34.666 --> 00:15:36.500
Hawlu-lu-lu-lu-lucha!

294
00:15:39.066 --> 00:15:42.400
- Hawlucha, are you OK?
- Pika!

295
00:15:42.466 --> 00:15:45.000
- Please! You two have got to stay calm!
- Lade, Gallade!

296
00:15:46.933 --> 00:15:48.866
Hawlu...

297
00:15:48.933 --> 00:15:52.366
- You've got to keep going!
- The show's just getting started!

298
00:15:52.433 --> 00:15:54.966
- Hawlucha, you can do it!
- Denne-ne!

299
00:15:55.033 --> 00:15:57.700
Ha-cha. Hm?

300
00:15:57.766 --> 00:16:03.900
- Lu, Lucha.
- Cha.

301
00:16:03.966 --> 00:16:05.200
- Ha.
- Ha.

302
00:16:05.266 --> 00:16:06.833
- Huh?
- Pika?

303
00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.933
What in the world are those two doing?

304
00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:18.300
Hm. Lucha!

305
00:16:18.366 --> 00:16:20.766
- Cha!
- Cha!

306
00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:24.466
Lucha!

307
00:16:24.533 --> 00:16:28.766
- Argh! Lucha!
- Cha!

308
00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:31.666
- That's not in the script!
- What's going on?

309
00:16:31.733 --> 00:16:34.766
- Carl, maybe you should stop them!
- No, wait!

310
00:16:34.833 --> 00:16:37.600
Shining, go! Shining, go!

311
00:16:37.666 --> 00:16:39.633
Shining, go! Shining, go!

312
00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:43.133
Shining, go! Shining, go! Shining, go!

313
00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:51.200
Shining, go! Shining, go! Shining, go! Shining, go!

314
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:55.033
Lucha!

315
00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.833
Hawlucha. Hawlu-lucha!

316
00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.100
Look at that expression.

317
00:17:00.166 --> 00:17:01.900
I haven't seen it in so long!

318
00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.766
- Hawlu...
- Cha!

319
00:17:08.833 --> 00:17:10.766
Cha!

320
00:17:13.766 --> 00:17:16.700
Urgh!

321
00:17:19.266 --> 00:17:23.400
Dark, you can do it! Dark, you can do it!

322
00:17:23.466 --> 00:17:28.133
Dark, you can do it! Dark, you can do it! Dark, you can do it!

323
00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.100
- Hawlu-cha!
- Cha!

324
00:17:31.166 --> 00:17:33.500
Hawlu!

325
00:17:33.566 --> 00:17:36.233
- Look at them go!
- Denne-ne!

326
00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.900
The audience is going wild!

327
00:17:37.966 --> 00:17:40.433
Look at that! Dark Hawlucha's changing the script

328
00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.866
- on the fly for Hawlucha!
- Of course!

329
00:17:42.933 --> 00:17:44.100
Dark Hawlucha's moved

330
00:17:44.166 --> 00:17:46.866
by Hawlucha's raw determination and spirit!

331
00:17:46.933 --> 00:17:50.266
How could I ever stop Dark Hawlucha, with passion like that?

332
00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:53.400
- Go! Both of you!
- Pika! Pika!

333
00:17:53.466 --> 00:17:55.533
Lu-cha!

334
00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.433
- Hawlucha!
- Cha!

335
00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:01.500
- Stay strong, Hawlucha!
- Pika! Pika!

336
00:18:01.566 --> 00:18:04.966
Just a little bit more!

337
00:18:05.033 --> 00:18:07.500
Cha! Cha!

338
00:18:07.566 --> 00:18:10.166
Yeah, way to go!

339
00:18:14.033 --> 00:18:18.266
- Hawlucha!
- Huh!

340
00:18:18.333 --> 00:18:19.400
- Close call!
- Pika!

341
00:18:19.466 --> 00:18:22.966
Dark Hawlucha won't give up, either!

342
00:18:23.033 --> 00:18:24.866
Hawlu!

343
00:18:28.666 --> 00:18:31.166
Wish I could understand them.

344
00:18:31.233 --> 00:18:33.100
I wish I could understand them too.

345
00:18:33.166 --> 00:18:37.400
But there's no doubt that Dark Hawlucha's having a wonderful time.

346
00:18:37.466 --> 00:18:41.700
I'm sure it wants this moment to last forever!

347
00:18:48.366 --> 00:18:50.533
Hah!

348
00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:56.233
Lu!

349
00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.000
Lucha!

350
00:19:03.166 --> 00:19:05.666
Wow! Magnificent!

351
00:19:05.733 --> 00:19:07.333
I was worried about the outcome,

352
00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.466
but I never thought it would end like this!

353
00:19:09.533 --> 00:19:13.166
- Thank goodness.
- What a nerve-racking show.

354
00:19:13.233 --> 00:19:16.200
You said it. I guess all's well that ends well. Right?

355
00:19:16.266 --> 00:19:19.200
Huh?

356
00:19:19.266 --> 00:19:25.700
- Huh? Ha-cha.
- Lucha.

357
00:19:36.366 --> 00:19:38.500
- Thanks for everything!
- Pika, pika!

358
00:19:38.566 --> 00:19:41.466
That was a wonderful experience I'll never forget.

359
00:19:41.533 --> 00:19:43.533
A show like I've never seen before!

360
00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.500
- Yeah. I sure had a lot of fun!
- Denne!

361
00:19:46.566 --> 00:19:49.966
You know, I'm the one who should be thanking all of you.

362
00:19:50.033 --> 00:19:53.733
I know Dark Hawlucha's satisfied, and the crowd had a great time.

363
00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:57.200
OK, we're all ready to go, Carl!

364
00:19:57.266 --> 00:19:58.733
Then we'll be right there!

365
00:19:59.733 --> 00:20:02.233
Will there be more Super Pokémon Battle Shows?

366
00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:05.966
Yup! Of course! Gallade's leg is fully healed.

367
00:20:06.033 --> 00:20:09.966
We'll be putting on Super Pokémon Battle Shows everywhere we can.

368
00:20:10.033 --> 00:20:14.000
- Good luck, you guys!
- Good luck to you with your battling.

369
00:20:14.066 --> 00:20:17.233
- Let's promise to give it all we've got!
- Right!

370
00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.666
- Pikachu!
- Gallade, gal!

371
00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:23.466
Lucha. Hawlucha.

372
00:20:24.733 --> 00:20:26.466
Hawlucha.

373
00:20:31.033 --> 00:20:33.366
A proud, hardworking Dark Hawlucha

374
00:20:33.433 --> 00:20:36.400
has inspired our heroes with a courageous performance

375
00:20:36.466 --> 00:20:38.833
at the Super Pokémon Battle Show.

376
00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.800
Now, it's on the road once again to the Coumarine City Gym,

377
00:20:42.866 --> 00:20:47.100
as the Kalos region journey continues!
